": \"Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How are the letters installed on buildings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are these LED letters suitable for large-scale branding projects?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. With letter sizes ranging from 24\\\" to 120\\\" and deep returns up to 24\\\", these letters are ideal for architectural-scale corporate branding and landmark signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical brightness of the internal LED illumination?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The internal LED arrays provide brightness levels of up to 5,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility in both daytime and nighttime conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to standard flat LED signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"3D fabricated letters offer greater dimensional impact and depth, enhancing brand presence with architectural scale and superior light diffusion compared to flat LED signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty offered for these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty covering the fabri