finish available in any RAL color.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What illumination options are available for the 3D fabricated LED letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How are the letters installed on buildings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Are these LED letters suitable for large-scale branding projects?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. With letter sizes ranging from 24\\\" to 120\\\" and deep returns up to 24\\\", these letters are ideal for architectural-scale corporate branding and landmark signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the typical brightness of the internal LED illumination?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The internal LED arrays provide brightness levels of up to 5,000 nits, ensuring excellent visibility in both daytime and nighttime conditions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to standard flat LED signs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"3D fabricated letters offer greater dimensional impact and depth, enhancing brand presence with architectural scale and superior light diffusion compared to flat LED signage.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty offered for these letters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty covering the fabrication, finish, and LED illumination components to ensure long-term performance and reliability.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"3D Fabricated LED Letters\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/3d-fabricated-led-letters\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressC