de powder coating. Internal LED arrays provide even illumination across deep letterforms. Ideal for building-mounted corporate identity and landmark signage.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What materials are used in the construction of these LED letters?</h3><p>The letters are constructed from welded aluminum, ensuring durability and lightweight strength. The automotive-grade powder coating provides a high-quality finish available in any RAL color.</p><h3>What illumination options are available for the 3D fabricated LED letters?</h3><p>Illumination options include front-lit, halo-lit, or dual illumination, allowing versatile lighting effects that enhance brand visibility both day and night.</p><h3>Can these letters withstand harsh weather conditions?</h3><p>Yes, the letters are engineered to withstand wind loads up to 120 mph and are powder-coated for corrosion resistance, making them suitable for outdoor architectural applications.</p><h3>How are the letters installed on buildings?</h3><p>Installation is flexible with options for stud mounting or using a raceway mount, depending on the building surface and structural requirements.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"3D Fabricated LED Letters Dubai - Premium 3D LED Signs UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Order high-quality 3D Fabricated LED Letters in Dubai. Brightluxx UAE delivers durable and vibrant 3D LED sign solutions.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/3d-fabricated-led-letters\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"pa